=2 Walkthrough
!Beaucedine Glacier (S)- Songbirds in a Snowstorm.jpg|right|
\**Note:** You must be on the main {p:Wings of the Goddess} mission {M:Fate in Haze|Fate in Haze|Fate in Haze}, and have zoned and waited one game day after completing {q:Bonds That Never Die|Bonds That Never Die|Bonds That Never Die} in order to start this quest.{br}{br}Remember to grab a {i:Flint Stone|Flint Stone|768} and fishing rod for this quest.
* Speak to {n:Rholont} in {z:Southern San d'Oria (S)} at (E-7).
* Speak to {n:Daigraffeaux} in {z:Southern San d'Oria (S)} at (I-11).
* Enter {z:Beaucedine Glacier (S)} for a cutscene.
* Examine the {p:Colossal Footprint} behind the tower at (I-7). You will be asked to get 3 Key Items.
* Examine the {p:Rocky Perch} by the lake at (G-10) to get a {p:Goliath Worm}. You need to examine it **at least 3 times**, may take multiple attempts. You can easily fish up all 3 KI at the ocean, with 0 fishing skill.
* Fish for a {@k} {k:Paladin lobster} at the pond located at (G-10).
* Fish for a {@k} {k:Scutum crab} at the pond located at (J-7).
* Fish for a {@k} {k:Lance fish} at the pond located at (H-9).

Return to the {p:Colossal Footprint} at (I-7) for a cutscene to turn in your Key Items.
* Trade a {i:Flint Stone|Flint Stone|768} to {p:Charred Firewood} located **two levels** above and immediately north of the (I-7) tower.
* Examine the {p:Compressed Snow} that is located at (H-10) near/just south of the tower in the lowest part of the zone.
* Examine the **Compressed Snow** again to spawn a {p:Notorious Monster|Category:Notorious Monsters} named {m:Orcish Bloodletter}.
* Examine the **Compressed Snow** again for a cutscene that ends the quest and your reward.

